    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A New Retro Classic Space Shooter Arcade Game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WE HAVE ALIENS, YOU DON'T!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend Earth from waves of martian invaders and flying saucers in this modern version of a space shooter. Start out with a defensive shield while blasting your way through 30 stages of invaders with robotic voice effects. Get bonus points for saving the army men and get the high score. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Modern Version of an 80\u2019s Space Shooter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30 Stages with Robotic Voice Effects. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Waves of Martian Invaders and Flying Saucers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destructible Defensive Shield. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bonus Points for Army Men Saved. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arcade High Score. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gamepad Support. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Go Back to the 1980\u2019s and Blast these Martians Back into Outer Space!</strong></p>",
